# ssh — provider for hosting without containers (Oderland, Cloudnet, ...):
# the artifact is still the site's prod image (build once, same digest),
# but the placement is extract → rsync → post-deploy script on the host.
# Proven against vi.se/Oderland 2026-08-31 (docs/decisions/2026-08-30-site-release-ux.md).
NAME=ssh
KIND=addon
REQUIRES=deploy
